For each of the {{$json.sensors.length}} sensor(s) above, write a short urgent or calm description (~68 characters) interpreting the value's impact on the {{$json.crop.type}} plant at the {{$json.crop.growth_stage}} stage.

Return a JSON array of exactly {{$json.sensors.length}} objects, each with "type" and "description" only.
